### 1. Utwórz nowy raport
POST http://localhost:5000/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

{
  "work_start": "2025-10-22T09:00:00",
  "work_end": "2025-10-22T17:00:00",
  "project": "Website Redesign"
}

###

### 2. Utwórz raport bez work_end (praca w toku)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

{
  "work_start": "2025-10-22T18:00:00",
  "project": "Mobile App"
}

###

### 3. Pobierz wszystkie raporty użytkownika
GET http://localhost:5000/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

###

### 4. Pobierz raporty filtrowane po projekcie
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports?project=Website Redesign
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

###

### 5. Pobierz konkretny raport
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

###

### 6. Zaktualizuj raport
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/reports/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

{
  "work_end": "2025-10-22T18:30:00"
}

###

### 7. Usuń raport
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/reports/1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

###

### 8. Pobierz listę projektów użytkownika
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

###